abstract: >-
  Maple procedures and worksheets, with MATLAB commands, for the quasinormal modes of scalar, electromagnetic and
  vector-type gravitational perturbations of Lee–Wick black holes, non-extremal and extremal of types A and B. The
  radial equation is compactified, its quasinormal boundary conditions are built into a factorisation of the solution,
  and a Chebyshev collocation in multiprecision arithmetic gives a quadratic eigenvalue problem solved with polyeig.
